<SiteLayout title="Software Products for Business Operations | VYQDA" description="Explore VYQDA software products for workforce management, field operations, restaurant POS, retail billing and storage workflows." canonical="https://vyqda.com/products/" active="products">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero__inner"><p class="page-eyebrow">VYQDA SOFTWARE PRODUCTS</p><h1>Practical software for <em>everyday business work.</em></h1><p class="page-hero__lead">Explore focused software products built to support attendance, field operations, restaurant workflows, retail tasks and operational needs.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss Your Requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button--secondary" href="/products/">Explore Products</a></div></div></section>
<section class="content-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading-page"><p class="section-kicker">OUR PRODUCT PORTFOLIO</p><h2>Tools for specific jobs. One accountable technology partner.</h2><p>Choose a product based on the workflow you need to improve. Product capabilities and fit can be discussed with our team.</p></div><div class="page-grid">
<article class="page-card"><span class="page-card__number">01</span><h3>Timenox</h3><p>Attendance and workforce management for teams that need clearer records and simpler daily processes.</p><a href="/products/timenox/">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
<article class="page-card"><span class="page-card__number">02</span><h3>Timenox 360</h3><p>Field operations and distributed team visibility for organisations coordinating work across locations.</p><a href="/products/timenox-360/">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
<article class="page-card"><span class="page-card__number">03</span><h3>Vyfoo Restaurant POS</h3><p>Point-of-sale and restaurant workflow software for everyday service and transaction management.</p><a href="/products/vyfoo/">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
<article class="page-card"><span class="page-card__number">04</span><h3>VYQDA Retail</h3><p>Retail billing and inventory-oriented workflows for store operations.</p><a href="/products/retail/">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
<article class="page-card"><span class="page-card__number">05</span><h3>SHYFT Box Finder</h3><p>A focused tool for labelling boxes and finding stored items at home or in an office.</p><a href="/products/shyft-box-finder/">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
<article class="page-card"><span class="page-card__number">06</span><h3>Need something tailored?</h3><p>When an off-the-shelf product is not the right fit, discuss a custom software solution.</p><a href="/services/">Explore services <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="content-section content-section--tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading-page"><p class="section-kicker">HOW TO CHOOSE</p><h2>Start with the workflow, not the feature list.</h2><p>Each product addresses a different operational problem. Before choosing one, describe who will use it, how work is recorded today, which exceptions create friction and what a useful result would look like. That makes it easier to check product fit and identify gaps that may require configuration, integration or custom development.</p></div><div class="page-grid"><article class="page-card"><h3>Map the everyday journey</h3><p>Walk through a normal working day from the first action to the final record or transaction. Include corrections, approvals and hand-offs that happen when the expected process breaks down.</p></article><article class="page-card"><h3>Check operational constraints</h3><p>Confirm devices, connectivity, user permissions, data handling and the reports managers actually need. Treat these as acceptance criteria to validate, rather than assuming every product supports every environment.</p></article><article class="page-card"><h3>Plan ownership after rollout</h3><p>Decide who will manage users, review records, handle questions and approve changes. Where the product cannot meet a requirement as it stands, compare an integration or tailored workflow before committing to a wider build.</p></article></div><p class="page-hero__lead">The goal is a workable fit for the business, with clear limits and responsibilities—not a longer checklist of features.</p></div></section>
<section class="content-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="page-cta"><div><h2>Not sure which product fits?</h2><p>Tell us about your workflow and we can help you identify the most relevant starting point.</p></div><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Start a Conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({ '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'CollectionPage', name:'VYQDA Software Products', url:'https://vyqda.com/products/', description:'Software products for attendance, field operations, restaurant POS, retail and storage workflows.', mainEntity:{ '@type':'ItemList', itemListElement:[{ '@type':'ListItem',position:1,name:'Timenox',url:'https://vyqda.com/products/timenox/'},{ '@type':'ListItem',position:2,name:'Timenox 360',url:'https://vyqda.com/products/timenox-360/'},{ '@type':'ListItem',position:3,name:'Vyfoo Restaurant POS',url:'https://vyqda.com/products/vyfoo/'},{ '@type':'ListItem',position:4,name:'VYQDA Retail',url:'https://vyqda.com/products/retail/'},{ '@type':'ListItem',position:5,name:'SHYFT Box Finder',url:'https://vyqda.com/products/shyft-box-finder/'}] } })}></script>
</SiteLayout>